+	 * CPU reads. gpu_cached=1 makes them ordinary cached memory. (kunzite, main repo
+	 * ios/gpu-glue-plan.md 3.2: topaz's note here that a write-combined IOBMD comes out contiguous,
+	 * from the lower DDR bank, does not hold for this tree's IOBufferMemoryDescriptor: only
+	 * kIOMemoryPhysicallyContiguous, a physical mask or an alignment above a page does that.)
+	 */
+	cached = 0;
 	(void)PE_parse_boot_argn("gpu_cached", &cached, sizeof(cached));
 	gGPUCached = cached != 0;
